<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SpiritStory // Hype & Spirits</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="logo">SPIRIT//<span>STORY</span></div>
            <div class="search-container">
                <div class="search-bar">
                    <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Cerca drop, storie, distillati...">
                    <button class="btn-search">GO</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/stories">STORIE</a></li>
                <li><a href="/shop">SHOP</a></li>
                <li><a href="/birre">BIRRE</a></li>
                <li class="cart-icon"><a href="#">BAG [<span class="badge">0</span>]</a></li>
                <li><a href="/login" class="btn-login">LOGIN</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="floating-assets">
                <img src="/images/jack.png" class="bottle jack-anim" alt="Jack Daniel's">
                <img src="/images/ipa.png" class="bottle beer-anim" alt="Premium Beer">
            </div>

            <div class="hero-content">
                <div class="ticker">LIMITED DROP // EXCLUSIVE HISTORY</div>
                <h1>JACK DANIEL'S <br><span class="text-neon">SPECIAL EDITION</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-sub">L'anima underground del Tennessee incontra il design street. Scopri le bottiglie più rare e la storia di chi ha cambiato le regole.</p>
                <div class="hero-btns">
                    <a href="/shop" class="btn-street-primary">ACQUISTA ORA</a>
                    <a href="/product-detail" class="btn-street-secondary">VEDI PRODOTTO</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="street-badge">
                <span>BETA V.1</span>
                <span>2026©</span>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer><p>SPIRITSTORY // PROGETTO ESAME 2026</p></footer>
</body>
</html>